>-> why can i "see" monsters all over the level having the
>   intrinsic telepathy, but only in a range of about 10 (?)
>   positions around mine when wearing an amulet of ESP?

That's just the way it is... Not much you can do about it (nothing, in
fact).

>-> when killing a shopkeeper (being lawful), will this always
>   remove the intrinsic telepathy or a random intrinsic?

Intrinsic telepathy will be removed when you attack ANY peaceful
creature, not only shopkeepers. You don't need to kill them, either:
attacking alone is enough.

>-> How often can i expect to meet a priest of "my" god? And where
>   in the dungeons? I think my priest, now being on the medusa level
>   has met only one priest (neutral) in the gnomish mine town.
>   Can priest be converted as altars???

Priests cannot be converted. If you didn't meet a priest so far, you're
probably out of luck, though you might find one between the Medusa and
the Castle, if you're VERY lucky (not sure about this, though: are the
levels between these two always filled with mazes?).

Of course, you can opt to become neutral yourself, if you REALLY want
or need a priest of your own. There are ways to do this, but I am not
sure of them right away (offering a unicorn of your own colour on a
neutral altar should work, I guess).

>-> what is the difference between a scroll of "scare monster"
>   and "confuse monster"?

Monsters won't thread on the first one (there are exceptions, though)
and the latter one will make the first monster you hit wander randomly
for a while.

